{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it and process it. If an obstacle in front, move around it. Finally, find object nearby. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleInFront    /> <Action ID = MoveAroundObstacle    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
